": "ss5.png", "id": "1152092902082065", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035384_1152092905415398_3671014561611948556_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BTFGFJZVNTUQ7kNvwEAsOqr&_nc_oc=AdqnZBnn1R7i2OQm6_cZwhgutuhp38Ggq74r4_ztVQFJj1LGeuN34nk0FwjprF9Gilk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG5SgGi1kH4Dz4zH4coUJdf84rCg7nSJebYQ8kLmTA2mw&oe=6A85AA03"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FIREZONE3Test2560x1440.png", "id": "2950852928552779", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974756_2950852931886112_4069845081673903176_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=efHHlz-80aIQ7kNvwEgx5jf&_nc_oc=Adq0fxm0Tq4wSqCR36mJW1PMdyBG0BYZCAnOJYHJ6WNtemZ0myHbvz-zRuWqdErcFjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGaxyeK7UiEwFbGNZmOjrzOE5GGddvKjofUQfutINz4fg&oe=6A858C55"}, "display_name": "FireZone", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Hop onto the battlefield in VR like never before. In large scale battles of up to 16 people, players can hitch a ride in multiple types of vehicles, land or air, to compete across intense game modes featuring exciting VR combat and chaotic gameplay. \n\n- Control a variety of vehicles such as jeeps, tanks, and helicopters\n- Huge battles of up to 16 players, with AI bots as well\n- Fight through multiple classic game modes like Team Deathmatch and Capture the Flag.\n- Two large, intense maps with elevation and plenty of sight lines for each class to succeed in", "short_description": "FireZone is an all-out battle of shooting, vehicles, and explosions!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://soaringrocstudio.net/policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Soaring Roc Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://soaringrocstudio.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context